=== Text #4 ===
> After a night raiding two instances, killing Chimaeron[ and] Cho’gall[, we] took a nice relaxing break to the waters of V[ash]j’ir.
However it turned out Doug had a sinister[ plan] for the spot as[ he immediately] turned[ his] attention to the[ Whale Shark] swimming around[.] Many insisted that we’re[ gonna] need a bigger[ boat], but channeling his inner Ahab[ he went] ahead[ and aided by] Ds[,] Runningfree, Lurppis,[ H]vid, Morgain, Sun[bl]azer[ and] Mar[ij]ana the[ shark was] kited to death[ to complete] From Hell�[�s] Heart I Stab at Thee.
