The Tommies (12-1 overall, 8-0 MIAC) ran[ their win] streak to 12 and[ stayed] in a share of the MIAC lead with[ St]. John's. They also helped amend an 0-3 record last season against[ Aug]sburg. Senior Connor Bair finished with 28 points, 14 rebounds and four blocks.
